<title>USA: Wall Street stocks open slightly lower.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks open slightly lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks were generally lower at Tuesday's opening, with weakness concentrated among Nasdaq stocks.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials were down five points to 5877. The NASDAQ Index was off four to 1223.</p>
